Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:17:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-10 (b): mod entities are seen on the clients and the LAN
 as an item display of the skin's model

Each mod entity gets a carrier, an item_display summoned beside it whose item_model is the skin's model (assets/<ns>/items/<path>.json of the mod). It moves with the entity each tick, is made again when the skin or the name changes or its chunk comes back, goes with the entity, and carriers a save kept are swept before the first new one. Tracking, the LAN and the drawing are the display's own.

